foundation.question_text:
How many books were borrowed from the Mobile service?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.7]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,6.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(7.5,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/10,2/20,3/30,4/40,5/50} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$};
\draw (0.4,0) rectangle (1.6,3); \draw (2.4,0) rectangle (3.6,5); \draw (4.4,0) rectangle (5.6,4); \foreach \x/\lab in {1/Central,3/Mobile,5/East} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,2.5) {Books}; \node[below] at (3,-1.0) {Service}; \node at (3,6.1) {Library loans};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Find the total number of volunteer shifts shown.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.68]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,6.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(9,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/5,2/10,3/15,4/20,5/25} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$};
\draw (0.4,0) rectangle (1.6,4); \draw (2.4,0) rectangle (3.6,3); \draw (4.4,0) rectangle (5.6,5); \draw (6.4,0) rectangle (7.6,2); \foreach \x/\lab in {1/North,3/South,5/West,7/East} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,2.5) {Shifts}; \node[below] at (4,-1.0) {Centre}; \node at (4,6.1) {Volunteer shifts};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The line graph shows calls received each hour. Find the total for the five observations.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.8]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,7.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(8.5,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/5,2/10,3/15,4/20,5/25,6/30} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$};
\foreach \x/\lab in {1/9am,2.4/10am,3.8/11am,5.2/12pm,6.6/1pm} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};} \draw[thick] (1,2)--(2.4,5)--(3.8,3)--(5.2,6)--(6.6,4); \foreach \p in {(1,2),(2.4,5),(3.8,3),(5.2,6),(6.6,4)} {\fill \p circle (2.5pt);}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,3) {Calls}; \node[below] at (3.8,-1.0) {Time}; \node at (3.8,7.1) {Help-line calls};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

