Find the combined number of visits to Clinic A and Clinic D, then compare it with Clinic C.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.68]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,7.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(9,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/20,2/40,3/60,4/80,5/100,6/120} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$};
